      "data": {
        "text": "\"Create describe_image.py in the current working directory.\nTask: generates a short visual description for an image.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc27ae1500156uRM4alCzIRwT",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc27ae13001vwP3KRl1NrSPkl",
